      "description": "<p>After you make a Check while you bear the <strong>Symbol of Destiny</strong>, if the symbolist is able to see you, they may spend 1 <strong>Fabula Point</strong> to force you to reroll both dice. They may only do so once per Check, and only if the Result was not a <strong>critical success</strong> or <strong>fumble</strong>.</p>",
